WEBVTT

00:01:46.932 --> 00:01:50.652
Soul Contract

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:54.919
Tenth Contract

00:01:56.966 --> 00:01:59.063
Subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:15.340
I'm Duanmu Siming

00:02:15.343 --> 00:02:17.500
A house steward of Duanmu household

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:19.130
My job

00:02:19.136 --> 00:02:22.999
is to arrange and manage domestic affairs for the Master

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:28.260
As a great, versatile family member of high standing,

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:32.840
my ability to resolve domestic issues is my greatest pride

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:36.140
And I help to protect my family

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:38.460
This is what I pursue in life

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:42.082
Young Master

00:02:42.082 --> 00:02:43.387
I'm coming in

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.220
Young Master

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:52.620
Breakfast has arrived

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:55.120
Hurry up and taste it

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:56.900
Y-Young Master?

00:03:05.092 --> 00:03:07.376
Y-Young Master

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.430
Could he be...?

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:17.740
You tryna be spooky?

00:03:18.794 --> 00:03:20.122
An assassin!

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:22.380
Oh, it's you, Mr. Soul Image

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.340
Brother Siming

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:24.860
Not that I wanna criticize

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:28.460
but cats or dogs won't wake up if you do it this way

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:31.800
Although your voice sounds soothing and lovely

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:33.120
but it sucks

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.080
Lemme teach you

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.980
the right way to howl in bed

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:39.370
Howl... in bed?

00:03:53.182 --> 00:03:54.591
WAKE UP!!!

00:03:54.591 --> 00:03:56.515
Rise and shine!

00:03:56.515 --> 00:03:58.923
Don't let the sun burn your butt hole!

00:03:58.923 --> 00:04:00.043
Wake up quick!

00:04:00.043 --> 00:04:03.104
Better keep your organs healthy now!

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:06.500
What the hell are you trying to do?!

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:07.680
See?

00:04:07.685 --> 00:04:09.094
He woke up

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:12.820
The guy who risked his life howling

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:13.940
is Yang Jinghua

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.110
He's the Soul Image approved by the Young Master a few days ago

00:04:17.112 --> 00:04:19.667
- Through the Master's soul contract,
- Your kick was so brutal!

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:22.400
- he's able to maintain his soul condition in this world
- It's only a wake-up call.  Good thing I'm a spirit

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.620
If it were somebody else,

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:25.640
he would've been killed by your kick

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:26.560
Speaking of which,

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:28.700
you're so bad at waking up

00:04:28.704 --> 00:04:30.263
Don't blame me for telling you

00:04:30.263 --> 00:04:32.560
but you sleep almost like a corpse

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.705
If there's a quake or flood,

00:04:34.705 --> 00:04:36.735
you're dead for sure

00:04:39.260 --> 00:04:40.900
Young Master, please take a look

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.420
at today's schedule

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:43.040
Alright

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:43.880
I will

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.410
7:40AM

00:04:48.413 --> 00:04:49.648
Breakfast time

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:50.670
Wow sheesh!

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:52.280
A banquet for breakfast

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:53.840
This is the life of rich folks

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:55.440
Quite an early show-off

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:00.440
I wanna eat

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:01.560
I really wanna eat

00:05:01.797 --> 00:05:03.312
Bring me a spoon

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:04.480
Yes

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:08.450
Open up

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:14.920
Mr. Soul Image

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:17.000
is an unusual weirdo

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.560
Tasty!

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.680
Is this what luxury tastes like?

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:22.860
Although it's all veg

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.650
but it's so flavorful

00:05:24.659 --> 00:05:27.502
Flavorful banzai!

00:05:28.566 --> 00:05:30.271
It's been so long I've not seen

00:05:30.271 --> 00:05:32.612
him showing such a gentle smile

00:05:32.815 --> 00:05:35.240
All thanks to Mr. Soul Image

00:05:35.252 --> 00:05:36.320
I wanna eat this

00:05:36.329 --> 00:05:37.126
And that

00:05:37.126 --> 00:05:38.020
And this

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:39.960
Enough already, Yang Jinghua

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.560
I'm not obligated to feed you

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:43.020
I don't care, I don't care

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:44.840
I need you for the stuffs I can't touch

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.180
You're responsible for me

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:47.780
A lifetime responsibility

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:50.180
I wanna eat, I wanna eaaatttt

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:50.870
I wanna...

00:05:50.873 --> 00:05:53.393
I'll force you to reincarnate as a pig!

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:56.520
And because of him, the Master

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:58.980
sometimes loses his austere

00:06:00.351 --> 00:06:02.689
We can't accept the Situ's request

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:05.180
They not only wanted a split of West altar,

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.960
they also asked for a 60%

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:08.450
This is going too far

00:06:08.455 --> 00:06:10.549
Their request may be unreasonable

00:06:10.549 --> 00:06:12.956
but they're gaining power in recent years

00:06:12.956 --> 00:06:16.101
We still depend on their ability in spirit control

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:21.350
Being a Master can be quite tedious

00:06:23.585 --> 00:06:25.256
Bring me the ledger

00:06:25.256 --> 00:06:26.713
I'll take a look

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:27.880
Yes

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:29.570
8AM every morning

00:06:29.572 --> 00:06:31.429
is the family's usual meeting

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.030
The meeting's now over

00:06:37.854 --> 00:06:38.677
Oh yeah,

00:06:38.677 --> 00:06:40.384
I'm going to bed

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:41.920
Don't try to wake me up

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:42.700
What?!

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:43.800
Sleep again?!

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:46.680
You never open your eyes at the meeting, alright?

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:47.770
10AM

00:06:47.772 --> 00:06:49.569
Morning meeting ended

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:52.140
Noon 11:30AM

00:06:52.148 --> 00:06:53.474
Lunch time

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:54.880
12PM

00:06:54.881 --> 00:06:56.351
Lunch finished

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.300
Evening 7PM

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:00.020
Dinner time

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:00.740
8PM

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:02.080
- Dinner finished
-Good night

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.230
My gosh

00:07:03.233 --> 00:07:05.109
Besides eating, you sleep whole day

00:07:05.109 --> 00:07:06.562
Why aren't you getting fat?

00:07:06.562 --> 00:07:08.535
Even the gods are furious

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:18.245
Duanmu Xi is so handsome

00:07:18.245 --> 00:07:18.960
Goddamn

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:20.580
Why he comes to school today?

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:23.080
Why doesn't he keep staying at home?

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.800
I never expect

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:26.720
you're so popular among both sexes

00:07:27.437 --> 00:07:28.252
Irritating

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:30.560
The hell?

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:31.580
You massacred everyone

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:32.420
Normally,

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:34.220
when the Master comes to school

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.870
I always follow behind

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:38.080
First, I need to keep him safe

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:38.920
Second,

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.520
I need to keep others safe

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:41.160
Hello

00:07:41.167 --> 00:07:43.522
Is this the ambulance?

00:07:50.118 --> 00:07:51.287
Not again

00:07:51.287 --> 00:07:52.660
Duanmu Xi

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:55.980
Don't assume you're rich, you have the right to look down others!

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:58.480
You dare not listen in my class?

00:07:58.508 --> 00:07:59.663
Duanmu Xi!

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:00.400
Now,

00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:00.920
Hurry up,

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:01.620
Immediately,

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.360
Solve this problem

00:08:05.147 --> 00:08:08.468
Even the teacher got frustrated

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.540
Serves you right for that bad attitude

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.360
The teacher invests lots of effort

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:13.640
giving such tough question

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:17.100
He really wanna make a fool out of Duanmu, doesn't he?

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:18.260
Done

00:08:18.269 --> 00:08:19.347
What?

00:08:19.347 --> 00:08:20.161
So quick

00:08:20.161 --> 00:08:22.852
Your character design is so idol

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:34.160
Duanmu Xi

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:35.980
This is my handmade lunchbox

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:37.230
for you to taste

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.710
I don't eat out

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:46.140
Pretty girl & tasty food right in front yet you won't take it?

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:47.160
These are meat

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:48.290
MEAT

00:08:48.291 --> 00:08:49.499
You're hopeless

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:52.120
like a dog that got used to eating dung

00:08:57.477 --> 00:08:58.385
Mr. Soul Image

00:08:58.626 --> 00:08:59.896
Don't be disheartened

00:08:59.896 --> 00:09:03.845
The Master's meal is specially cooked and delivered from home

00:09:03.845 --> 00:09:05.224
Even if it looks good

00:09:05.224 --> 00:09:08.188
but it's hard to live without meat

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:09.900
If you don't feel like eating much,

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.330
you might as well don't eat it

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.520
Besides, a spirit

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:14.800
doesn't need to eat

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:15.850
Damn you!

00:09:15.852 --> 00:09:17.239
I shoulda eat you!

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:23.880
After observing their interaction,

00:09:23.883 --> 00:09:25.207
I feel

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:26.600
that they both

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.110
seem to like teasing each other

00:09:31.193 --> 00:09:32.301
Sleep again?

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:33.580
You just finished lunch

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:34.320
Duanmu Xi

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:37.050
Aren't you afraid of putting on weight when you age?

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.960
Is this guy a cat?

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:42.420
By the way, Siming

00:09:42.426 --> 00:09:44.272
Is it fine to let him be?

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.670
What's wrong?

00:09:45.676 --> 00:09:50.762
Duanmu Xi is completely indulged in early retirement lifestyle

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:53.080
Every day he just eats and sleeps

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:54.580
Then eats and sleeps again

00:09:54.587 --> 00:09:56.302
He doesn't work at all

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:58.580
Calling him sleepyhead just sounds too endearing

00:09:58.580 --> 00:09:59.690
What's more annoying

00:09:59.697 --> 00:10:01.696
When I asked him when he's going to work

00:10:01.696 --> 00:10:03.024
He responded,

00:10:03.024 --> 00:10:04.597
"I'm not short of cash"

00:10:04.597 --> 00:10:06.151
"Why do I need to work?"

00:10:08.134 --> 00:10:10.116
But I wanna do some work

00:10:10.116 --> 00:10:14.692
I hate the feeling of being kept by someone like a toy boy

00:10:14.925 --> 00:10:17.442
Mr. Soul Image is a hardworking guy

00:10:17.442 --> 00:10:19.584
but he's not what you assume he is

00:10:19.584 --> 00:10:21.114
What do you mean?

00:10:21.441 --> 00:10:23.661
Young Master is no ordinary priest

00:10:23.661 --> 00:10:27.663
He only performs ritual on a few specific days within a year

00:10:27.663 --> 00:10:30.302
So, what's the purpose of Yangming Masters anyway?

00:10:30.302 --> 00:10:33.056
As what you saw at the ceremony

00:10:33.056 --> 00:10:34.410
He purifies

00:10:34.754 --> 00:10:36.415
He does mass purification

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:37.880
When there's energy imbalance,

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:39.300
geographical disturbance

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:41.730
or any huge turmoil caused by spirits

00:10:41.731 --> 00:10:42.841
The Young Master

00:10:42.841 --> 00:10:44.383
will calm it

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:49.700
He's not required to do the usual job of exorcising evil spirits

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:51.280
Unless there're diabolical spirits,

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.620
then our family will do it

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:55.380
And the Master is not the only person in Duanmu family

00:10:55.384 --> 00:10:56.989
The Duanmus are well-known

00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:58.680
as most of us are professionals

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:00.990
Therefore he has nothing much to do

00:11:00.992 --> 00:11:03.525
So the richer you get, the duller you become?

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:05.920
Now that I see him eating and sleeping

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.740
I bet he'll have 3 "highs" (High blood pressure, high cholesterol, high glucose)

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:08.480
Bald

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:09.880
and a big belly

00:11:09.882 --> 00:11:13.098
Mr. Soul Image really likes joking

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:15.820
I sure hope I'll get to see that one day

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:16.540
What?

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.800
You wanna see Duanmu Xi

00:11:18.802 --> 00:11:20.335
bald and big bellied?

00:11:20.335 --> 00:11:24.020
I didn't expect you're this nasty too

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:29.640
But there's one thing you don't know

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:32.050
Yangming Masters

00:11:32.271 --> 00:11:34.707
never grow old

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:50.540
Since ancient times, only the talented gets to become the head of Duanmu family and Yangming Master

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:53.330
Although Duanmu Xi isn't a direct bloodline of this family

00:11:53.333 --> 00:11:57.021
His wisdom and power is no less than any Yangming Masters

00:11:57.021 --> 00:11:59.052
Let him take up the job

00:11:59.052 --> 00:12:00.400
to fulfill godly duties

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.897
and helping humanity

00:12:01.897 --> 00:12:03.050
Siyun

00:12:03.050 --> 00:12:04.194
Siming

00:12:04.194 --> 00:12:06.988
Give the Young Master a bow

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:08.690
2nd sister

00:12:08.692 --> 00:12:11.912
congratulating Young Master ascends to post

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:18.140
Brother Siming

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:23.120
is now the only one I have

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:25.140
Don't worry

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:26.830
Your brother

00:12:26.835 --> 00:12:30.383
will always stay by your side

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:32.560
Damnit!

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.120
You have it so easy

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:37.350
You got paid one whole episode with so little dubbing
